Warehouse --> UC62

' ============================================
' RELATIONSHIPS - CỬA HÀNG TRƯỞNG
' ============================================
StoreManager --> UC2
StoreManager --> UC4
StoreManager --> UC5
StoreManager --> UC20
StoreManager --> UC21
StoreManager --> UC22
StoreManager --> UC23
